  <para style="h">Hebri</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebri bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebri</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hib</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hebri bi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu tu munyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Blema be ɔ mi lokoo ɔ, Mawu gu blɔ slɔɔtohi a nɔ nɛ e kɛ wa nɛmɛ tu munyu kɛ gu gbali ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ e je e blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ kpo bɔɔbɔɔ kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ ngɛ nlamihi kɛ ní namihi kɛ he si jemi mi.<verse eid="HEB 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Se ngɛ be nɛ ɔmɛ a mi lɛɛ e gu e Bi ɔ nɔ nɛ e kɛ wɔ tuɔ munyu. Bi nɛ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ e ngɔ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ kɛ ha; nɛ e nɔ nɛ e gu kɛ bɔ je ɔ kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ mi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Lɛ e mi nɛ Mawu anunyami ɔ kpɛɔ ngɛ; nɛ bɔ nɛ Mawu Bi ɔ ngɛ kɛ ha, kɛ níhi nɛ e peeɔ ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa Mawu ji lɛ, nɛ e he wami ji nɔ́ nɛ hɛɛ adebɔ tsuo. Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ gbo nɛ e kɛ tsukɔ wa he nɛ e kɛ je wa he yayami ɔmɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ, e ya hi si ngɛ anunyami pe kulaa mi ngɛ Mawu Ope ɔ kasa nya ngɛ hiɔwe.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e ba kle kulaa pe bɔfo ɔmɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ e biɛ “Mawu Bi” nɛ e Tsɛ ɔ kɛ ha lɛ ɔ tsɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Ejakaa Mawu de we bɔfo ɔmɛ eko hyɛ ke, “Ye Binyumu ji mo, nɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ i ngɛ mo anunyami nɛ jamɛ a biɛ ɔ hɛɛ ɔ hae.” Se e de enɛ ɔ ngɛ Yesu he. Be kpa ko hu e de ngɛ e he ke, “Ami ji e Tsɛ, nɛ e ji ye Bi.” <verse eid="HEB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Nɛ be nɛ e wo e Bi Tete ɔ kɛ ba je ɔ mi ɔ, e de ke, “Mawu bɔfo ɔmɛ tsuo a ja lɛ.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Nɔ́ nɛ Mawu de ngɛ e bɔfo ɔmɛ a he ji, a he sɔɔ kaa kɔɔhiɔ, nɛ a ngɛ kaa tsɔli nɛ a kɛ la lilɛ bɔ mɛ. <verse eid="HEB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Se nɔ́ nɛ e de ngɛ e Binyumu ɔ he ji, “Oo Mawu, o matsɛ yemi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene; nɛ o kojomi ɔmɛ da be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="HEB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />O suɔ nɔ́ dadɛ, nɛ o sume nɔ́ nɛ hí; nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu, o Mawu ɔ ha mo bua jɔmi babauu pe nɔ fɛɛ nɔ.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Mawu hu tsɛ lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ”, benɛ e de ke, “Nutsɔ, o bɔ je ɔ kɛ je sisije; nɛ o nine nya ni tsumihi ji hiɔwe nibɔ ni ɔmɛ. <verse eid="HEB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />A hɛ mi ma kpata ligbi ɔ ko, se moo lɛɛ o maa hi si kɛ ya neneene. Mɛ tsuo a maa pee kaa he hami ni momohi, <verse eid="HEB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />nɛ o ma koklo mɛ ligbi ko kaa a kokloɔ bo. Nɛ o ma tsake mɛ, se moo lɛɛ o maa hi ja daa nɛ o jeha amɛ a nya be tae ligbi ko.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Anɛ Mawu de bɔfo ko hyɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e de e Bi ɔ ke, “Moo hi si ngɛ ye hiɔ nine nɔ ngɛ anunyami mi kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma wo o he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɔ pee sɛ nɛ o ma wo o nane ngɔ ma nɔ” lo?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Dabi, ejakaa bɔfo ɔmɛ a ji mumi mi tsɔli nɛ a tsɔ nɛ a ba ye kɛ bua ni nɛmɛ nɛ a ma na e yi wami hemi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo gbo kɛ ha wɔ tsuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e bi nɛ waa bu anɔkuale ɔ nɛ wa nu ɔ tue saminya bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa ko ngmɛɛ he. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Ejakaa ke ji sɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ ba deɔ wɔ ɔ peeɔ anɔkuale, nɛ a gblaa nimli a tɔmi tsuaa tɔmi he tue ɔ nɛɛ, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />kɛ e maa pee kɛɛ nɛ wa maa ye wa he ke ji wa pɛtɛ we kikɛmɛ a yi wami hemi agbo nɛ ɔ nɛ Nutsɔ Yesu nitsɛ fiɛ nɛ nihi nɛ nu ɔ ba de wɔ ɔ he?<verse eid="HEB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Nɛ Mawu nitsɛ hu ye he odase kaa e munyu ɔ anɔkuale i, kɛ gu okadihi kɛ nyakpɛ nihi kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ he wami nɛ e kɛ ha nihi nɛ he ye ɔ a nɔ. Mawu ha wɔ tsuo nike ni nɛ ɔmɛ eko.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Nɛ je nɛ maa ba nɛ wa ngɛ he munyu tue nɛ ɔ, tsa pi bɔfo ɔmɛ nɛ maa ye nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Dabi, ejakaa ngɛ La Womi ɔ mi ɔ, David de Mawu ke, “Mɛnɔ ji nɔmlɔ nɛ o susuu e he, aloo Nɔmlɔ bi nɛ e kɔmɔ peeɔ mo kɔmɔ? <verse eid="HEB 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />E ngɛ mi kaa o bɔ lɛ nɛ o ba lɛ si bɔɔ pe bɔfo ɔmɛ mohu, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, o ha lɛ bumi kɛ anunyami. <verse eid="HEB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Nɛ o wo nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɔ wo e sisi, nɔ́ ko nɔ ko piɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Wa nɛ kaa enɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ba mi lolo, <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />se wa na Yesu, nɔ nɛ jinɛ a ba lɛ si bɔɔ pe bɔfo ɔmɛ ɔ, Mawu ha lɛ bumi kɛ anunyami, ejakaa e na nɔ nɛ e gbo ngɛ wa he. Ngɛ Mawu mɔbɔ nami babauu ɔ he je ɔ, Yesu gbo kɛ ha je ɔ tsuo. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Nɛ e da nɛ e sa kaa Mawu, nɔ nɛ bɔ níhi tsuo kɛ ha lɛ nitsɛ e anunyami he ɔ, e ha nɛ Yesu na nɔ, konɛ e kɛ kpaka e bimɛ fuu kɛ ba hiɔwe; nɛ Yesu nɔ́ nami ɔ ha nɛ e pee Kpakalɔ nɛ hi kɛ pi si, kɛ nɔ nɛ sa nɛ e ngɔ mɛ kɛ ya a yi wami hemi ɔ mi.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Wɔ nihi nɛ Yesu pee wɔ klɔuklɔu ɔ, waa kɛ lɛ tsuo ngɛ Tsɛ kake amlɔ nɛ ɔ. Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ e pee we lɛ zo kaa e ma tsɛ wɔ e nyɛmimɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Nɛ e de ngɛ La Womi ɔ mi ke, “I ma gba Mawu ye Tsɛ ɔ he sane kɛ ha ye nyɛmi ɔmɛ, nɛ wɔ tsuo wa ma la kɛ je e yi.” <verse eid="HEB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Nɛ e de be kpa mi hu ke, “I kɛ ye nyɛmi ɔmɛ ma wo wa hɛ ngɔ fɔ e nɔ.” E de ekohu ke, “Ami kɛ bimɛ nɛ Mawu ngɔ ha mi ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Nɛ akɛnɛ wɔ nɛ wa ji Mawu bimɛ ɔ, adesahi ji wɔ, nɛ he lo kɛ muɔ ji wɔ he je ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ hu e wo jamɛ a bɔmi su ɔ ngɔ fɔ e nɔ, nɛ a fɔ lɛ kaa Nɔmlɔ adesa, ejakaa ja e plɛ adesa loko ji e ma nyɛ gbo, konɛ e gu gbenɔ mi nɛ e kɛ puɛ abosiami he wami nɛ hɛɛ gbenɔ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Konɛ e kɛ kpɔ nihi kulaa nɛ gbenɔ gbeye yemi he je ɔ, a pee kaa nihi nɛ ngɛ nyɔguɛ si himi mi a wami ligbi ɔmɛ tsuo ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Wɔ tsuo wa le kaa e bɛ je ɔ mi kaa Mawu bɔfo, se mohu e ba kaa nɔmlɔ adesa nɛ a fɔ lɛ Yuda no. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Nɛ e sa kaa Yesu e hi kaa wɔ e nyɛmi ɔmɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ konɛ e nyɛ nɛ e pee mɔbɔ nalɔ kɛ anɔkua Osɔfo Ngua ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ e pee Osɔfo nɛ maa na wɔ mɔbɔ nɛ e maa ye Mawu anɔkuale ngɛ adesahi a yayami ɔmɛ a he ni tsumi mi. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Nɛ akɛnɛ lɛ nitsɛ hu e na nɔ, nɛ a ka lɛ he je ɔ, e le wa nɔ́ nami kɛ kami ɔmɛ nɛ e ma nyɛ maa ye kɛ bua wɔ.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo se nyɛɛli ji Mawu we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ye nyɛmimɛ nɛ Mawu hla kɛ ha lɛ nitsɛ e he, nyɛ nihi nɛ a hla kɛ ha hiɔwe, nyɛ juɛmi nɛ e ya Yesu, nɔ nɛ ji Mawu Tsɔlɔ kɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a he.<verse eid="HEB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Yesu ye Mawu, nɔ nɛ wo lɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a, anɔkuale kaa bɔ nɛ Mose hu ye anɔkuale ngɛ Mawu we ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Se kɛ hu ɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ wetsɛ naa yi jemi babauu pe e we nɛ e ma nɛ ngɛ fɛu ɔ, ja a kɛ̃ nɛ Yesu na yi jemi pe Mose. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Nɛ nihi fuu ma nyɛ ma wehi, se Mawu ji nihi tsuo a bɔlɔ.<verse eid="HEB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Mose tsu ni saminya ngɛ Mawu we ɔ, se sɔmɔlɔ kɛkɛ ji lɛ; nɛ nɔ́ nɛ e ni tsumi ɔ tsɔɔ pɔtɛɛ ji níhi nɛ maa ba hwɔɔ se ɔmɛ a he odase yemi. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Se Kristo nɛ ji Mawu Binyumu anɔkuale yelɔ ɔ lɛɛ, lɛ ji Mawu we ɔ nɔ hyɛlɔ kɛ pi si. Nɛ wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli lɛɛ wɔ ji Mawu we, nɛ e hii wa mi, ke ji wa hɛɛ wa ka a mi kpɛii kɛ bua jɔmi, nɛ wa pɛtɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi ɔ he kɛ ya si nyagbe.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7-8" />Akɛnɛ Kristo kle pe wɔ hluu he je ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ deɔ wɔ ke, “Mwɔnɛ ɔ ke nyɛ nu e gbi ɔ, nyɛ ko wlua nyɛ tsui nɛ nyɛ tsɔ atuã kaa bɔ nɛ e ba mi ngɛ nga a nɔ ɔ, nɛ nyɛ tsɛ ɔmɛ wa a tsui, nɛ a tu munyu kɛ si lɛ benɛ e ngɛ mɛ kae ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 3:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Se Mawu to tsui si kɛ ha mɛ jeha nyingmi eywiɛ sɔuu; tse be ɔ, a ka lɛ. Se loloolo ɔ, e ya nɔ nɛ e tsu nyakpɛ ni nguahi kɛ ha mɛ nɛ a na. <verse eid="HEB 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Nɛ Mawu de ke, ‘Se i na a he abofu saminya, ejakaa be fɛɛ be ɔ a tsui be ye he, a tsui ngɛ ní kpahi a se nyɛɛe nɛ a laa blɔ. A nyɛɛ we blɔ ɔ nɛ i ngɛ hlae kaa a nyɛɛ nɔ ɔ nɔ.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mawu wo a he abofu nɛ e na a kɛ ka kita ke e be hae nɛ a ba e he jɔɔmi ɔ mi ligbi ko.”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsuihi nɛ wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ e hi, anyɛmimɛ, nɛ nyɛ ko na yayami peemi tsui nɛ ma ha nɛ nyɛ be hee maa ye, nɛ nyɛ ma tsɔ kɛ je Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Se mohu nyɛɛ tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ bi daa ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he, be nɛ ɔ mi nɛ be ngɛ kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ yayami nɛ ko sisi nyɛ nɛ nyɛ wlua nyɛ tsui kɛ wo Mawu. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Ejakaa ke wa ye anɔkuale kɛ ya si nyagbe, nɛ wa ngɔ wa hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ wa pee kekle be mi nɛ wa plɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔ, lɛɛ waa kɛ Kristo maa ye e ni ɔmɛ.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Be ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. Nyɛ hɛ nɛ ko je si womi ɔ nɔ ke, “Mwɔnɛ ɔ ke nyɛ nu e gbi ɔ, nyɛ ko wlua nyɛ tsui kaa bɔ nɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ pee be nɛ a tsɔ atuã ngɛ e hɛ mi ɔ.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Mɛnɔmɛ nɛ a nu Mawu gbi nɛ e kɛ mɛ ngɛ munyu tue se a tsɔ atuã a? Anɛ pi mɛ nihi nɛ Mose kpaka kɛ je Mizraim ɔ? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Nɛ mɛnɔmɛ nɛ a wo Mawu mi mi la jeha nyingmi eywiɛ sɔuu ɔ? Anɛ pi ni nɛ ɔmɛ nɔuu nɛ pee yayami, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ a gbo ngɛ nga a nɔ? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Nɛ mɛnɔmɛ nɛ Mawu kɛ ngɛ munyu ɔ tue benɛ e kã e he kita nɛ e de ke a be zugba nɛ e wo e bi ɔmɛ he si ɔ nɔ sue ligbi ko ɔ? Anɛ pi nihi kulaa nɛ bui lɛ tue ɔ nɛ e ngɛ dee? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Nɛ mɛni he je nɛ a nyɛ we zugba a nɔ nɛ a ya su ɔ? Ejakaa a he we lɛ yi.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Hejɔɔmi hé he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />E ngɛ mi kaa Mawu si womi kaa nɔ fɛɛ nɔ maa sɛ e he jɔɔmi ɔ mi ɔ ngɛ kɛ sa, se e sa kaa waa ye gbeye nɛ wa he nɛ kpokpo, ejakaa eko ɔ nyɛ ti nihi be mi nyɛe maa sɛ. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Ejakaa munyu ɔ nɛ ba su wɔ kaa Mawu ngɛ hlae nɛ e he wa yi wami ɔ, ja a nɔuu nɛ a kɛ ya ha nihi nɛ hi si ngɛ Mose be ɔ mi, se munyu ɔ nɛ a nu ɔ yí kɛ bua we mɛ, ejakaa a he we yi. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Ejakaa wɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ wa he Mawu nɔ ye ɔmɛ pɛ nɛ wa maa sɛ e he jɔɔmi ɔ mi. E de ke, “I kã kita ngɛ ye abofu ɔ nya ke nihi nɛ he we ye nɔ yi ɔ, a be ye he jɔɔmi ɔ mi sɛe ligbi ɔ ko,” tse be mi ɔ, e pee klaalo kɛ ngɛ mɛ mlɛe kɛ je be mi nɛ a bɔ je ɔ tɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Nɛ wa le kaa e pee klaalo nɛ e ngɛ mlɛe, ejakaa a ngma ke, Mawu jɔɔ e he ngɛ ligbi nɛ ji kpaago ɔ nɔ benɛ e bɔ níhi kulaa gbe nya a.<verse eid="HEB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Nɛ tete po a sɛ we mi, ejakaa Mawu de ngɛ nyagbe mi kulaa ke, “A be ye he jɔɔmi ɔ mi sɛe.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Se kɛ ɔ, si womi ɔ ngɛ, nɛ ni komɛ sɛ mi, se pi ni nɛmɛ nɛ na kekle he blɔ ɔ, ejakaa a gbo Mawu tue nɛ a sɛ we mi.<verse eid="HEB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Se e to be kpa nɛ a kɛ ba mi, nɛ jamɛ a be ɔ ji mwɔnɛ ɔ. E fiɛɛ enɛ ɔ kɛ gu Matsɛ David nɔ blema bebeebe benɛ nɔmlɔ nyɛ we mi nɛ e sɛ kekle ɔ, nɛ e de kaa bɔ nɛ a de momo ɔ ke, “Mwɔnɛ ɔ ke nyɛ nu ye gbi ɔ, nyɛ ko wlua nyɛ tsui” ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Se he jɔɔmi hé he nɛ ɔ nɛ e ngɛ he munyu tue ɔ, e pi Israel zugba a, he nɛ Yoshua kpaka mɛ kɛ ya a. Kaa lejɛ ɔ he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue ɔ jinɛ tsa pi pee se nɛ e maa tu jamɛ a munyu ɔ nɛ e ma de ke, “mwɔnɛ ɔ” ji e mi sɛmi ligbi ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, he jɔɔmi kulaa ngɛ kɛ ha Mawu bimɛ kɛ sa. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Nɛ Kristo ya sɛ lejɛ ɔ momo ngɛ e he jɔɔe ngɛ e ni tsumi ɔ nyagbe ɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu pee benɛ e bɔ níhi kulaa gbe nya a. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Lɛɛ nyɛ ha nɛ wa gbo dengme nɛ wɔ hu wa ya sɛ jamɛ a he jɔɔmi ɔ mi, nɛ e ko ba mi kaa wa ma ya gbo Mawu tue kaa bɔ nɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ pee nɛ a sɛ we mi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Ejakaa Mawu munyu ngɛ he wami, nɛ e ngɛ hɛ ngmle, nɛ e nya ba pe ha nya enyɔtsɛ, nɛ e gbɔɔ kɛ yaa wa mi tsitsaa he nɛ wa susumi kɛ akɔnɔ ni ɔmɛ ngɛ ɔ, nɛ e jeɔ bɔ nɛ wa ngɛ ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />E le bɔ nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ ha ngɛ he fɛɛ he. Nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ wa he ɔ fɔɔ si paa ngɛ wa Mawu hɛ kalɔ nɛ naa nɔ tsuaa nɔ ɔ hɛ mi. A be nyɛe ma wo nɔ́ ko kɛ laa lɛ, nɛ lɛ wa maa jaje nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ wa tsu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, wa Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Se Yesu nɛ ji Mawu Bi ɔ ji wa Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma, nɔ nɛ ho hiɔwe nitsɛ ya konɛ e ye kɛ bua wɔ ɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ wa he e nɔ waa ye nɛ wa ko jɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Wa Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma nɛ ɔ le wa gbɔjɔmi ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ e nuɔ he kɛ haa wɔ, ejakaa a ka lɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a kaa wɔ hu ɔ, se lɛɛ e ha we he blɔ nɛ ka ko nɛ ye e nɔ gblee nɛ e pee yayami.<verse eid="HEB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ wa wo kã kɛ hɛ kɛ su Mawu dloomi matsɛ sɛ ɔ nitsɛ he, nɛ waa hi lejɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa nine nɛ su mɔbɔ nami nɔ; nɛ wa na dloomi nɛ maa po wa he kpa ngɛ fimi be mi.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Yuda bi ɔmɛ a Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a ji nɔmlɔ kaa bɔ nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ ɔ; se a hla lɛ konɛ e da nimli kulaa a nya ngɛ a kɛ Mawu a sanehi a mi. E ngɔɔ a nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ haa Mawu, nɛ e kɛ lohwehi a muɔ saa bɔ kɛ haa lɛ ngɛ nimli ɔmɛ a he yayami kɛ lɛ nitsɛ e he yayami ɔ he. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Akɛnɛ lɛ hu nɔmlɔ adesa ji lɛ he je ɔ, e naa tsui si tomi kɛ haa a gbɔjɔmi kɛ a tɔmi ɔmɛ, ejakaa lɛ nitsɛ hu e naa jamɛ a kami ɔmɛ nɔuu. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Nɛ kaa lɛ nitsɛ hu yayami peelɔ ji lɛ he je ɔ, e sa nɛ e sã bɔ, pi kɛ ha ni ɔmɛ kɛkɛ a he yayami, se lɛ nitsɛ hulɔ.<verse eid="HEB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Nɔ kake nɛ e sa nɛ a kai ji kaa nɔ ko be nyɛe nɛ lɛ nitsɛ e maa pee e he Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma. E sa nɛ Mawu nɛ tsɛ lɛ kɛ ha ni tsumi nɛ ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ e tsɛ Aaron ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ Kristo nitsɛ wui e he Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a nɛ; dabi, Mawu nɛ hla lɛ, nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ye Bi ji mo, mwɔnɛ nɛ ɔ i wo o hɛ mi nyami.” <verse eid="HEB 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Be kpa ko hu Mawu de lɛ ke, “I hla mo nɛ o ye osɔfo kɛ ya neneene, nɛ o maa hɛɛ blɔ nya nɛ Melkizedek hɛɛ ɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Benɛ Kristo ngɛ je ɔ mi ɔ, e sɔle kɛ e hɛ mi vo nyu nɛ e susuma hao, nɛ e kpa Mawu, nɔ nɛ pɛ nɛ ma nyɛ kpɔ lɛ kɛ je gbenɔ dɛ mi ɔ pɛɛ. Nɛ e Mawu tue bumi he je ɔ, a nu e sɔlemi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />E ngɛ mi kaa Mawu Bi ji Yesu lɛɛ, se e gu nɔ́ nami nɔ kɛ kase tue bumi. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Nɛ benɛ Yesu, kɛ gu e nɔ́ nami ɔmɛ a mi ɔ e hi kɛ pi si ɔ, e ba plɛ nɔ nɛ mi nɛ neneene yi wami nami jee kɛ haa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ buɔ lɛ tue ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Nɛ nyɛ kai kaa Mawu pee lɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma nɛ hɛɛ blɔ nya nɛ kɛ Melkizedek nɔ́ ɔ sɔ.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu munyu nɛ mi kuɔ ɔ kasemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ he munyu fuu ngɛ nɛ wa ma nyɛ maa tu kɛ tsɔɔ nya; se e nya tsɔɔmi ɔ maa wa, ejakaa nyɛ nɔ sisi numi ngɛ yee.<verse eid="HEB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Nyɛ plɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli pi mwɔnɛ ɔ, nɛ jinɛ be nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, e sa kaa nyɛɛ hi ni kpahi ní tsɔɔe, se mohu nyɛ ba se kulaa bɔ nɛ e sa kaa nyɛ na nɔ ko nɛ e bɔni nyɛ Mawu munyu ɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ nyɛ kɛ je sisije ɔ tsɔɔmi ekohu. Nyɛ ngɛ kaa bimwɔwi nɛ nyɔ nyu nɛ e sa nɛ nyɛɛ nu se pi niye ni nɛ he wa. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ nyɔ nya lolo ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa e sui he ko kulaa ngɛ Kristo jami ɔ mi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e li slɔɔto tsɔ ko nɛ ngɛ kpakpa kɛ yayami kpɛti. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Nyɛ be nyɛe maa ye mumi mi niye ni nɛ he wa a, nɛ nyɛ maa nu Mawu Munyu ɔ mi níhi nɛ mi kuɔ ɔmɛ a sisi kɛ ya si be mi nɛ nyɛ maa pee Kristo se nyɛɛli kpakpahi nɛ nyɛ maa le slɔɔto nɛ ngɛ kpakpa kɛ yayami kpɛti nɛ nyɛ maa di kpakpa peemi se.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ wa si Kristo he sane ɔ sisije ni ɔmɛ a se nɛ waa ya wa hɛ mi ni ngua amɛ a nɔ, nɛ waa wa ngɛ nɔ sisi numi mi, kaa bɔ nɛ e sa nɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nikɔtɔmahi peeɔ. Nɛ anɔkuale ji, e he hia we kaa wa ma bɔni munyu tumi ekohu ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a he, kaa e ji kuasia jemi kaa a maa bɔ kpakpa peemi he mɔde kɛ na yi wami hemi, aloo kaa e he hia nɛ a na hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Mawu mi; <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />e he hia we kaa a tu nyɛ munyu ngɛ baptisimi kɛ mumi mi nike níhi kɛ gbogboehi a si temi kɛ nyagbe kojomi ɔ he hu.<verse eid="HEB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Ngɛ Mawu suɔmi nya a, wa maa ya nɔ nɛ waa kase ni kpahi jehanɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu kuami he hiɔ womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />E he hia we kaa a bɔ mɔde nɛ a tsɔɔ nyɛ Nutsɔ ɔ se blɔ ekohu ke ji nyɛ nu Manye Munyu ɔ sisi hyɛ nɛ nyɛ sa nyɛ nya kɛ hiɔwe ní kpakpahi hyɛ, nɛ nyɛ na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi nɔ́ ko, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />nɛ nyɛ le bɔ nɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ hi ha, nɛ nyɛ nu je nɛ ma a he wami ɔmɛ a he, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />nɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ, nyɛ te si kɛ si Mawu. Nɛ nyɛ be nyɛe ma tsake nyɛ tsui hu ke ji nyɛ sɛu Mawu Bi ɔ ngɛ tso nɔ ekohu, ejakaa nyɛ kua lɛ, nɛ nyɛ ngɔ lɛ kɛ ha he fɛu yemi kɛ hɛ mi si puemi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Ke hiɔmi nɛ ha ngmɔ hulɔ ko, nɛ e ngmɔ ni ɔmɛ ba saminya a, e tsɔɔ kaa jamɛ a zugba a na Mawu dɛ mi jɔɔmi. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Se ke e ba mi kaa zugba a ngɛ miohi kɛkɛ woe ɔ, a maa ngɔ kaa zugba a gbo, nɛ a maa ngmɛɛ he nɛ a maa sa lɛ la.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, e ngɛ mi kaa i ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ dee mohu, se i susu kaa nɔ nɛ i ngɛ dee ɔ kɔ we nyɛ he. I he ye kaa nyɛ ngɛ yiblii kpakpa woe nɛ ma ha nyɛ na yi wami hemi. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Ejakaa Mawu ɔ dalɔ ji lɛ. E hɛ be nyɛ ni tsumi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsue kɛ ngɛ lɛ hae ɔ nɔ jee; aloo nyɛ suɔmi nɛ nyɛ je kpo kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nɔ lolo kɛ ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ e we bi ɔmɛ buae ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Nɛ wa maa suɔ kaa nyɛɛ ya nɔ nɛ nyɛ je nyɛ suɔmi kpo kɛ tsɔɔ ni kpahi be abɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ wami mi ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ na nyɛ hiɔwo mluku ɔ kulaa hwɔɔ se.<verse eid="HEB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Jehanɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ na le nɔ́ nɛ fɔɔ si kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ, Mawu jami ɔ be nyɛ dengme pee, nɛ e be nyɛ hejɔ hu pee, se mohu nyɛ maa nyɛɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ Mawu wo mɛ si ngɛ a hemi kɛ yemi kɛ a tsui si tabuami he, nɛ a nine su nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɔ ɔmɛ a se.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Ejakaa benɛ Mawu wo Abraham si ɔ, e kã lɛ nitsɛ e he kita, ejakaa nɔ ko be nɛ kle pe lɛ Mawu ɔ nɛ e ma kã lɛ kita. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Nɛ e de ke, e maa jɔɔ lɛ nɛ e ma ha lɛ binyumu, nɛ e maa wo lɛ ma agbo nɔ tsɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Nɛ kaa Abraham to e tsui si he je ɔ, e nine su si womi ɔ nɔ. Mawu ha lɛ binyumu Isak, kaa bɔ nɛ e wo lɛ si ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ kãa nɔ ko nɛ kle pe lɛ ɔ kita konɛ lɔ ɔ nɛ ha nɛ e ye e si womi nɔ, aloo nɛ e gbla e tue ke e yí nɔ. Nɛ ke nya sami ngɛ nɔ kɛ nɔ a kpɛti nɛ a kã kita pɛ nɔ́ jemi ko be hu. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Nɛ akɛnɛ Mawu ngɛ hlae nɛ e tsɔɔ nihi nɛ e ngɛ si woe nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua a, kaa tsa pi munyu gu nɛ e tu nɛ e be e yi mi tomi ɔ tsakee he je ɔ, e kã e he kita kɛ ma nɔ mi.<verse eid="HEB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />E ha wɔ níhi enyɔ, nɛ ji e si womi kɛ kita nɛ e ka nɛ wa ma wo wa hɛ kɛ fɔ nɔ ɔ, ejakaa Mawu be nyɛe maa ye lakpa. Jehanɛ ɔ nihi nɛ tu fo kɛ ba sa we ɔ, a ma na he wami womi he ke a nu si womi nɛ ɔmɛ. Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, a ma na nɔ mi mami kaa e ma ha mɛ yi wami hemi nɛ e wo mɛ he si ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Hemi kɛ yemi kaa a ma he wa yi wami nɛ ɔ ngɛ kaa osɛkɛ kɛ ha wa susuma amɛ, nɛ e tsaa wɔ kɛ Mawu nitsɛ kpɛti ngɛ e he klɔuklɔu ngɛ hiɔwe, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />he nɛ Kristo sɛ wa hlami kɛ ho, nɛ e ya kpa pɛɛ kɛ ha wɔ, ejakaa e ba plɛ wa Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma nɛ hɛɛ anunyami kɛ blɔ nya nɛ Melkizedek hɛɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melkizedek nɛ ɔ ji Salem matsɛ kɛ Mawu Ope ɔ osɔfo. Melkizedek kɛ Abraham kpe nɛ e jɔɔ lɛ be mi nɛ Abraham ya hwu ta ngua ko nɛ e ye matsɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ e kpale kɛ ma a. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Abraham ha lɛ níhi nɛ e ya na ngɛ ta a mi tsuo mi gbami nyɔngma mi kake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 7:2">Melkizedek biɛ ɔ sisi tsɔɔmi ji, Dami sane yemi; nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Matsɛ dami sane yelɔ ji lɛ; nɛ jehanɛ ɔ se hu ɔ, he jɔmi Matsɛ ji lɛ. Ejakaa lɛ ji Salem matsɛ, nɛ Salem sisi ji he jɔmi. <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />E be tsɛ nɛ e be nyɛ, nɛ a li e weku no ko hu. A fɔ we lɛ nɛ e gbo we hulɔ. E wami he sane ngɛ kaa Mawu Bi ɔ nɔ́; e ye osɔfo kɛ yaa neneene.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Bɔ nɛ e klemi ngɛ ha ji enɛ ɔ nɛ! Abraham tete nɛ ji Mawu anunyami bi ɔmɛ nɛ e hla a, a ti nɔ nɛ pe kulaa a, ha lɛ e ta mi ni ɔmɛ a mi gbami nyɔngma mi kake. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />E sa nɛ a nu nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ Abniham pee enɛ ɔ ngɛ sisi, ke ji Yuda osɔfo ji Melkizedek, ejakaa pee se ɔ, a wo Mawu bi ɔmɛ mlaa kaa a ha a osɔfo ɔmɛ nike ni nɛ a kɛ ye kɛ bua mɛ, ejakaa a wekuli ji mɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Melkizedek pi a weku no, se Abraham ke lɛ ni nɛ ɔ, nɛ Melkizedek jɔɔ lɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ le kaa nɔ ko nɛ ngɛ nɔ jɔɔe ɔ, e kle pe nɔ nɛ e ngɛ jɔɔe ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />E ngɛ mi kaa nimli adesahi ji Yuda osɔfo ɔmɛ, se a heɔ mi dlami nyɔngma mi kake ɔ; nɛ a deɔ wɔ ke Melkizedek lɛɛ e ngɛ wami mi.<verse eid="HEB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Wa ma nyɛ de po ke Levi nitsɛ, nɛ ji Yuda osɔfo ɔmɛ kulaa a tsɛ nɛ heɔ mi dlami nyɔngma mi kake ɔ woɔ kɛ ya haa Melkizedek kɛ guu Abraham nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />E ngɛ mi kaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, a na we nɛ a fɔ Levi nɛ je Abraham weku ɔ mi ɔ lolo, be mi nɛ Abraham wo mi dlami nyɔngma mi kake ɔ kɛ ha Melkizedek ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Ke ji Yuda osɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ a mlaa amɛ nyɛ he wa yi wami ɔ, lɛɛ mɛni he je nɛ e he hia kaa Mawu nɛ e pa tsɔ Kristo kaa osɔfo nɛ e kɛ Melkizedek hɛɛ blɔ nya kake kɛ ba, nɛ e tsɔɛ nɔ ko nɛ e kɛ Aaron mohu hɛɛ blɔ nya sɔsɔɛ kaa bɔ nɛ osɔfo kpa amɛ kulaa hɛɛ ɔ kɛ bɛ?<verse eid="HEB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Nɛ ke Mawu tsɔ osɔfo mimi kpa a, lɛɛ e sa nɛ e mlaa a hu nɛ e tsake kɛ to he. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Se kaa bɔ nɛ wa le ɔ, Kristo ji Levi osɔfohi a weku ɔ mi, se mohu e je Yuda weku nɛ a hlɛ mɛ hyɛ kɛ ha osɔfo yemi ɔ mi. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />A ji weku nɛ Mose ha we mɛ jamɛ a ni tsumi ɔ hyɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />E fɔɔ si paa kaa Mawu blɔ nya tomi ɔ tsake, ejakaa Kristo nɛ ji Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma he ɔ, nɛ hɛɛ Melkizedek blɔ nya a, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />e ji Levi wɛtso ɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ ngɛ ɔ, se mohu a wo lɛ osɔfo ngɛ wami nɛ se be poe ɔ he je. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Ejakaa lɛ e he odase nɛ Latsɛ ɔ ye nɛ e de ke, “O maa ye osɔfo kɛ ya neneene, nɛ o maa hɛɛ Melkizedek blɔ nya.”<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />A po blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ nɛ a jee wɛtso ko mi kɛ yeɔ osɔfo ɔ mi, ejakaa a nyɛ we nɛ a kɛ tsu ni. He wami be mi, nɛ e he be se nami ejakaa e nyɛ we nihi a yi wami nɛ e he. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Ejakaa mlaa a ha we nɛ nɔ ko nɛ hi kɛ pi si ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi. Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, wa ngɛ he nɔ kami pe kekle ɔ, ejakaa Kristo ha nɛ wa sa Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ wa ma nyɛ hɛ kɛ su e kasa nya.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Mawu ka kita kaa Kristo maa ye osɔfo kɛ ya neneene, <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />se e de we ja ngɛ osɔfo kpa amɛ a he. Kristo pɛ he nɛ e de ngɛ ke, “Nutsɔ ɔ kã kita nɛ e be e juɛmi tsakee: Osɔfo ji mo kɛ yaa neneene, nɛ o maa hɛɛ Melkizedek blɔ nya a.” <verse eid="HEB 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Ngɛ Mawu kita a he je ɔ, Kristo ma nyɛ blɔ nya tomi he kpakpa nɛ ɔ manye yemi nɔ mi maa ma kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Ngɛ blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ nya a, osɔfo ɔmɛ hiɛ fuu bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ke nikɔtɔma amɛ gbo ɔ, ni kpahi a ye a nane mi.<verse eid="HEB 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Se Yesu lɛɛ e hɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene nɛ e ngɛ osɔfo yee, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ kpa ko he hia we hu. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Nɛ ja a he je ɔ, e ma nyɛ ma he nihi nɛ maa gu e nɔ kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ ɔ a yi wami kulaa. Nɛ akɛnɛ e hɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene he je ɔ, e ma kai Mawu daa ngɛ a he yayami ɔmɛ a he, kaa e wo a he hiɔ momo kɛ e muɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, lɛ ji Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma nɛ wa ngɛ hlae, ejakaa e ngɛ klɔuklɔu nɛ piami ko be e he, yayami ko be e he, nɛ yayami peeli hu puɛ we lɛ, nɛ a ha lɛ anunyami blɔ he ngɛ hiɔwe. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />E he hia we kaa e sã bɔ daa ligbi kɛ lohwehi a muɔ ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e yayamihi a he kekle, nɛ e pee ja kɛ ha ni kpa amɛ hulɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ osɔfo kpa amɛ peeɔ ɔ, ejakaa e pee enɛ ɔ si kake momo be nɛ e wo lɛ nitsɛ e he ngɔ sã bɔ ngɛ sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Ngɛ blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ blɔ fa mi ɔ, osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ nitsɛ ji gbɔjɔli, nɛ a peeɔ yayami, se pee se ɔ, Mawu kã kita nɛ e hla lɛ nitsɛ e Bi nɛ hi kɛ pi si kɛ yaa neneene ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo kɛ e he sã bɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Nɔ́ nɛ wa ngɛ dee ɔ ji: Kristo nɛ wa tu e osɔfo yemi he munyu piɔ ɔ ji wa Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma, nɛ e hii si ngɛ anunyami nɛ pe kulaa ngwɔ he ngɛ Mawu nitsɛ kasa nya ngɛ hiɔwe. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Nɛ e ngɛ sɔmɔe ngɛ sɔlemi we ɔ, anɔkua sɔlemi he nɛ tsa pi nɔmlɔ nɛ ma, se Nutsɔ ɔ nitsɛ nɛ e ma.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Akɛnɛ osɔfo tsuaa Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a, a hla lɛ nɛ e wo nike ni kɛ ba nɛ e sã bɔ he je ɔ, e he hia kaa Kristo hu e sã bɔ. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Nɛ bɔ nɛ lɛɛ e sa a, e hi kulaa pe bɔ nɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ osɔfo ɔmɛ saa a. Nɛ kaa e ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ tete po ɔ, a be lɛ he blɔ hae nɛ e ye osɔfo, ejakaa je nɛ ɔ mi osɔfo ɔmɛ saa bɔ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ sa. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Mɛɛ lɛɛ hiɔwe sɔlemi we ɔ e nini ji nɔ́ nɛ mi nɛ a ngɛ sɔmɔe ngɛ ɔ nɛ. Ejakaa benɛ Mose maa ma bo tsu ɔ, Mawu de lɛ ke e hyɛ nɛ e pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ kaa hiɔwe sɔlemi we ɔ, nɛ a je kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ ngɛ Sinai Yoku ɔ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a wo Kristo osɔfo ngɛ hiɔwe nɛ a ha lɛ blɔ nya nɛ hi hluu pe sɔmɔmi nɛ nihi sɔmɔ ngɛ somi momo ɔ sisi ɔ, ejakaa somi he ɔ nɛ e ngɔ kɛ ha wɔ kɛ je Mawu ngɔ ɔ hɛɛ si womihi nɛ hi pe kekle nɔ́ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Somi momo ɔ tsu we ni tete po. Ejakaa kaa e tsu ni ɔ, jinɛ ekpa he ko hia we hu nɛ a ma kɛ to e nane mi. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Mawu nitsɛ na e nimli ɔmɛ a tɔmi ɔmɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ e de ke, “Be ma nɛ i kɛ Israel we ɔ kɛ Yuda we ɔ maa so somi he. <verse eid="HEB 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Enɛ ɔ be hie kaa somi nɛ i kɛ a tsɛ ɔmɛ so be mi nɛ i nu a nine si nɛ i kpaka mɛ kɛ je Mizraim ɔ. Se mɛɛ a yi somi ɔ he nɛ kɔ a he ɔ nɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ i po mi. <verse eid="HEB 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ de ke, somi he ɔ nɛ i kɛ Israel we ɔ maa so ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ: I ma ngma ye mlaa amɛ kɛ wo a juɛmi mi konɛ a le nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ hlae nɛ a pee, nɛ ma ko de mɛ hu. Nɛ mlaa nɛ ɔmɛ maa hi a tsui mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ye nɔ, nɛ i ma pee a Mawu, nɛ a maa pee ye nimli. <verse eid="HEB 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Nɛ e be hiae kaa a tsɔɔ a si bi loo a huɛmɛ loo a nyɛmimɛ nɛ a de ke, ‘Mo hu moo le Nutsɔ ɔ,’ ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ, nɔkɔtɔma jio, jokuɛ jio, mɛ tsuo a le mi momo. <verse eid="HEB 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Nɛ i ma na mɛ mɔbɔ ngɛ a tɔmi ɔmɛ a he, nɛ i be a yayami ɔmɛ kaie hu.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Somi Momo ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Mawu tu si womi he nɛ ɔ kɛ somi he ɔ he munyu kaa nɔ́ nɛ e kɛ to momo ɔ nane mi, ejakaa momo ɔ e be be, nɛ e ngmɛɛ he.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ngɛ Mawu ke e nimli ɔmɛ a kpɛti kekle somi ɔ nya a, blɔ nya tomihi ngɛ kɛ ha jami kɛ jami he klɔuklɔu ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Tsuhi enyɔ ngɛ jami he nɛ ɔ. Níhi nɛ ngɛ kekle nɔ́ ɔ mi ji sika tsu lusu kɛ okplɔɔ kɛ e nɔ abolo pɔtɛɛ ko; nɛ a tsɛɔ lejɛ ɔ ke, He Klɔuklɔu. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Jehanɛ ɔ, tsu nya bo ko hu ngɛ. Ngɛ e se ɔ, tsu ko ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ a tsɛɔ ke, He Klɔuklɔu Pe Kulaa. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Níhi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ji, sika tsu bɔ sami la tɛ kɛ somi daka nɛ a wo sika tsu kɛ ha e he kulaa, kɛ tɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a ngma Mlaa Nyɔngma amɛ ngɛ nɔ ɔ, kɛ sika tsu kpluu nɛ mana ngɛ mi, kɛ Aaron tso ɔ nɛ tsiɛ ɔ, ngɛ somi daka a mi. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Ngɛ sika tsu daka a yi mi ɔ, o maa na bɔfohi nɛ a tsɛɔ ke kerubim ɔmɛ nɛ buu Mawu anunyami he ɔ, nɛ a gbɛ a pɛlihi a mi kɛ bu sika tsu daka a nya bumi nɔ nɛ a tsɛɔ ke mɔbɔ nami sɛ ɔ nɔ. Se nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a mi tsɔɔmi ɔ hiɛ lolo.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Nɛ ke a to nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ he blɔ nya gbe nya se ɔ, osɔfo ɔmɛ ya sɛɔ kekle tsu ɔ mi be mi nɛ a suɔ, nɛ a ya tsuɔ a ni tsumi. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Se Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a pɛ nɛ e yaa se tsu ɔ mi; nɛ e yaa lejɛ ɔ si kake too ngɛ jeha mi. Nɛ be tsuaa be ɔ, e hɛɛ muɔ nɛ e kɛ fiãa mɔbɔ nami sɛ ɔ nɔ kaa bɔ sami kɛ ha Mawu ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ kɛ ma a a yayamihi kɛ a tɔmihi a he.<verse eid="HEB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ wo enɛ ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ kaa ngɛ blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ sisi ɔ, nimli gu ɔmɛ be he blɔ nɛ a yaa he nɛ a tsɛɔ ke He Klɔuklɔu Pe Kulaa a, be abɔ nɛ kpo nɔ blɔ tsu ɔ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Nɛ kikɛmɛ a nɔ́ nɛ ɔ tsɔɔ wɔ nɔ́ ko pɔtɛɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ. Ejakaa ngɛ blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ nya a, a woɔ nike níhi kɛ bɔ sami nihi kɛ baa, se kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ nyɛ we nɛ a tsu nihi nɛ wo kɛ ba a a tsui he. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Ejakaa blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ hɛɛ kusumi ni peemihi nɛ kɔɔ niye ni mimi nɛ a maa ye, kɛ nɔ́ nɛ a maa nu, kɛ a he dumi he blɔ nya tomihi kɛ ni kpahi a he. Kikɛmɛ a blɔ nya tomi nɛ ɔmɛ fi ni ɔmɛ nɛ a ngmɛɛ we he kɛ ya si be nɛ Kristo ba kɛ Mawu blɔ nya tomi he nɛ hi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Kristo ba kaa Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma kɛ ha blɔ nya tomi kpakpa nɛ wa na jehanɛ nɛ ɔ. Nɛ e ho hiɔwe sɔlemi tsu agbo nɛ hi kɛ pi si nɛ pi nimli nɛ ma, aloo je nɛ ɔ e mi fã ko ɔ mi ya. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Nɛ e wo muɔ kɛ sɛ jamɛ a se tsu nɛ a tsɛɔ ke He Klɔuklɔu Pe Kulaa a mi nɛ e ya fĩa kɛ pue mɔbɔ nami sɛ ɔ nɔ si kake kɛ gbe nya; se e pi apletsihi kɛ na bihi a muɔ. Dabi, e wo lɛ nitsɛ e muɔ, nɛ lɛ nitsɛ e kɛ ha wɔ neneene yi wami.<verse eid="HEB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Somi he ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Nɛ ke ji, ngɛ blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ sisi ɔ, apletsihi kɛ na kuhi a muɔ kɛ na bihi a la zu tsukɔɔ nimli a he nɛ e jeɔ a yayamihi ɔ, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />lɛɛ si nyɛmɛ nɛ Kristo muɔ be nyɛe ma tsake wa si himi kɛ wa tsuihi. E bɔ nɛ e sa a jeɔ wɔ kɛ jee mlaa momo ɔmɛ a nɔ yemi he tsui yemi mi, nɛ wa hlaa kaa wa ma sɔmɔ Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ. Ejakaa ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ yemi kɛ buami nya a, Kristo ngɔ lɛ nitsɛ e he kɛ ha Mawu nɛ e gbo ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a he, lɛ nɔ nɛ e hi kɛ pi si, nɛ yayami ko loo tɔmi ko be e he ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Kristo wo somi he ɔ kɛ ba konɛ nihi kulaa nɛ a tsɛ mɛ ɔ, a ba nɛ a nine nɛ ba su nyakpɛ níhi nɛ Mawu wo mɛ si ngɛ he ɔ nɔ. Ejakaa Kristo gbo nɛ e kɛ kpɔ mɛ kɛ je tue gblami nɛ a ma na ngɛ a yayamihi nɛ a pee be mi nɛ a ngɛ somi momo ɔ sisi ɔ mi.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ke ji nɔ ko gbo nɛ e wo e nya si nɛ e tsɔɔ níhi nɛ a ma kɛ ha nihi ngɛ e gbenɔ se ɔ, a ha we nɔ ko nɔ ko nɔ́ ko kɛ yaa si a maa ma nɔ mi kaa nɔ ɔ gbo. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Nɛ a bɔni e nya si womi ɔ he ni tsumi ngɛ e gbenɔ se. Be abɔ nɛ e ngɛ je mi ɔ, nɔ ko be nyɛe maa da e nya si womi ɔ nɔ kɛ ngɔ e ni ɔmɛ nɛ e wo mɛ si ngɛ he ɔ eko. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ a fiã muɔ ɔ nɛ, nɛ a kɛ tsɔɔ Kristo gbenɔ, loko ji a je kekle somi ɔ tete he ni tsumi sisi. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Ejakaa benɛ Mose tsɔɔ nimli ɔmɛ Mawu mlaa amɛ tsuo se ɔ, e wo na bihi kɛ apletsihi a muɔ kɛ nyu kɛ jijɔ he bwɔmi tsutsu kɛ nyinyla nɛ e kɛ fiã nimli ɔmɛ kɛ womi ɔ nitsɛ hu nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Nɛ e de ke, nyɛɛ kɛ Mawu kpɛti somi ɔ, nɛ Mawu ha mi ke nyɛ pee ɔ, e he ni tsumi sisi jemi muɔ nɛ peeɔ okadi ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Nɛ ja a kɛ̃ nɛ e wo muɔ ɔ kɛ fiã bo tsu klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ jami ni ɔmɛ tsuo a nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Anɔkuale ji kaa ngɛ somi momo ɔ sisi ɔ, e piɛ́ nɔ́ ko nɛ a wo we muɔ kɛ jlua we. Nɛ ke a pue we muɔ si ɔ lɛɛ a ngɔɛ yayami ko kɛ ki.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Bɔ nɛ e ba ha nɛ e he hia kaa Mose nɛ e ngɔ lohwehi a muɔ kɛ jlua bo tsu klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ kɛ e mi nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, nɛ a ji níhi nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ a henɔ ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. Se hiɔwe nɔ́ ɔmɛ nitsɛ lɛɛ a jluaa mɛ kɛ bɔ sami nɛ he jua wa pe enɛ ɔmɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Ejakaa Kristo ya su hiɔwe nitsɛ nɛ e ya ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi jehanɛ kaa wa Huɛ. Nɛ tsa pi sɔlemi tsu nɛ nimli ma a mi nɛ e ngɛ, ejakaa zugba a nɔ nɔ́ ɔ lɛɛ e ji hiɔwe sɔlemi tsu nitsɛ ɔ e mimi kɛkɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Nɛ e ngɔɛ e he kɛ sɛ bɔ ɔ ekohu kaa bɔ nɛ zugba a nɔ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a ngɔɔ lohwe muɔ kɛ saa bɔ ngɛ He Klɔuklɔu Pe Kulaa a daa jeha a. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Kaa ja a ji bɔ nɛ e sa nɛ e pee ɔ, jinɛ e ko hi gboe daa nɛ kɛ je be nɛ a bɔ je ɔ. Se tsa pi ja i. E ba je kpo si kake ngɛ be ɔ nyagbe mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e ba gbo kɛ ha wɔ nɛ e je yayami kɛ ho kulaa.<verse eid="HEB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />A to kaa Nɔmlɔ ma gbo si kake pɛ, nɛ kɔlɔ ɔ se ɔ kojomi maa ba, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />ja nɛ Kristo hu ngɔ e he kɛ sã bɔ ngɛ nihi fuu a yayami he; nɛ e maa kpale kɛ ba ekohu, se pi ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a he.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 9:28">Se mohu e ngɔ yi wami hemi kɛ ma jehanɛ kɛ ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ lɛ blɔ hyɛe kɛ tsui si tomi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Somi Momo ɔ kɛ Somi He ɔ a kpɛti slɔɔto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Níhi nɛ a na kɛ je Yuda bi ɔmɛ a blema mlaa amɛ a mi ji ní kpakpahi nɛ Kristo maa pee kɛ ha wɔ ɔ a he nini kɛkɛ. Ngɛ blema blɔ nya tomi ɔ mi ɔ, a ngɛ bɔ sae be fɛɛ be daa jeha, se lɔ ɔ po nyɛ we ni ɔmɛ a yi wami nɛ e he. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Kaa e ma nyɛ a yi wami ma he jinɛ bɔ sami si kake pɛ ko hiɛ; jinɛ e ko tsukɔ jali ɔmɛ a he kulaa, nɛ a be he nue hu kaa yayami peeli ji mɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Se daa jeha bɔ sami nɛ ɔmɛ mohu haa nɛ a kai a yayami kɛ a tue gbomi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ Kristo de ngɛ ke, na kuhi kɛ apletsihi a muɔ be yayami nyɛe ma je ligbi ko.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ benɛ Kristo ma je ɔ mi ɔ, e de ke, “Oo Mawu, na kuhi kɛ apletsihi a muɔ sɛ o hɛ mi, lɔ ɔ he je nɛ o dla ye nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ɔ nɛ ma ngɔ fɔ si ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ nɔ kaa bɔ sami nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />O bua jɔɛ lohwehi a gbemi kɛ bɔ sami ngɛ o hɛ mi kɛ ha yayami jemi ɔ he.” <verse eid="HEB 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i de ke, “O nɛ, i ba nɛ ma ba tsu o suɔmi nya ni, nɛ ma ngɔ ye wami kɛ ha kaa bɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ ye he ngɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi kaa ma pee ɔ.”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Benɛ Kristo tu e bua nɛ jɔɛ bɔ sami slɔɔto ɔmɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ a ngɛ ngɛ blɔ nya tomi momo ɔ mi ɔ he munyu ta a, <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />jehanɛ ɔ, e de ke, “O nɛ mi. I ba nɛ ma ba ngɔ ye wami kɛ ha.” E po kekle blɔ nya tomi ɔ mi nɛ e ngɔ nɔ́ nɛ hi pe lɔ ɔ kɛ to nane mi. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Ngɛ blɔ nya tomi he nɛ ɔ nya a, a ngɔ wa yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke wɔ nɛ a tsukɔ wa he kɛ Kristo gbenɔ si kake too ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Se ngɛ somi momo ɔ mi ɔ, osɔfo ɔmɛ daa si daa ligbi ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ hɛ mi ngɛ bɔ sae, nɛ bɔ sami nɛ ɔmɛ hu nyɛ we gblee nɛ a je wa yayami ɔmɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Se Kristo ngɔ e he kɛ ha Mawu ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a he je, nɛ e ngɔ e he kɛ sã bɔ si kake too kɛ ha be fɛɛ be, nɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ, e ho ya hi si ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nine nɔ, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />nɛ e ngɛ mlɛe nɛ a ngɔ e he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ wo e nane sisi. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Ejakaa e wo e bɔ sami kake nɛ ɔ kɛ ha nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ e tsu a he ɔ, a hi kɛ pi si ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ yeɔ enɛ ɔ he odase, ejakaa e de ke, <verse eid="HEB 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Enɛ ɔ ji somi nɛ i kɛ Israel bi maa so, i ma wo ye mlaa amɛ kɛ wo a tsui mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a suɔ nɛ a ye nɔ. Nɛ i ma ngma ye mlaa amɛ ngɛ a juɛmi mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a le ye suɔmi nya ni be fɛɛ be.” <verse eid="HEB 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Nɛ e de ke piɛ he ke, “I be a he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ a tɔmi ni peemi ɔmɛ kaie hu.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Nɛ he nɛ a wo yayamihi ngɔ ke ngɛ kulaa kɛ yaa neneene ɔ, yayami he bɔ sami ko he hia we hu. <verse eid="HEB 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Anyɛmimɛ, enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ma nyɛ ya sɛ He Klɔuklɔu Pe Kulaa a, he nɛ Mawu ngɛ ɔ, ngɛ Yesu muɔ ɔ he je. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Enɛ ɔ ji wami blɔ he nɛ Kristo bli kɛ ha wɔ benɛ e gba tsu nya bo nɛ ji e he lo ɔ mi konɛ wa ya sɛ he klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi.<verse eid="HEB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Nɛ akɛnɛ wa Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a nitsɛ ji Mawu we ɔ nɔ yelɔ ɔ, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />nyɛ ha nɛ waa hɛ kɛ su Mawu he kɛ anɔkuale tsui kɛ hɛ nɔ kami kaa e ma he wɔ, ejakaa a ngɔ Kristo muɔ ɔ kɛ fiã wa nɔ nɛ a kɛ tsukɔ wa he,nɛ jehanɛ ɔ hu a fɔ wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ a he kɛ nyu nɛ mi tsɔ.<verse eid="HEB 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Jehanɛ ɔ nyɛ ha nɛ waa hyɛ yi wami hemi nɛ Mawu wo wɔ he si ɔ blɔ. Nɛ wa gba mi kpoo nɛ wa de ni kpahi, nɛ wa yi mi nɛ ko pee wɔ enyɔɔnyɔ. Ejakaa nɔ nɛ wo wɔ si ɔ, e pi lakpatsɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ di kpakpa peemi se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ e pee kɛ ha wɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ wa hla nɔ́ nɛ wa maa pee kɛ ye kɛ bua wa he, nɛ wa na suɔmi kɛ ha wa he, nɛ waa suɔ ni tsumi kpakpahi.<verse eid="HEB 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Wa hɛ nɛ hi nɔ, nɛ waa ba sɔlemi kpe ɔmɛ; se wa ko pee kaa bɔ nɛ ni komɛ pɔɔ peemi ɔ. Waa wo wa si bi he wami nɛ wa kai mɛ, ejakaa e kpalemi kɛ bami ligbi ɔ ngɛ sue.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Ejakaa nɛ wa le yayami kɛ pami he anɔkuale ɔ se ɔ, ke nɔ ko hɛ ngɛ he nɛ e pee yayami ɔ, Kristo gbenɔ ɔ be jamɛ a yayami ɔ nɔ hae; blɔ ko be nɛ a ma kɛ je jamɛ a yayami ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Se mohu Mawu mi mi fumi nɛ he ngɛ gbeye, nɛ maa sa e he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ la glegleegle ɔ pɛ ji nɔ́ nɛ piɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Ke nɔ ko tɔ Mose mlaa nɔ, nɛ a na odasehi enyɔ loo etɛ kɛ si lɛ ɔ, a buu lɛ gbenɔ fɔ nɛ mɔbɔ nami ko be mi. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Lɛɛ tue gblami nɛ a ma kɛ ha lɛ ɔ maa hi gbeye, nɔ́ nɛ a ma kɛ ha nɔ nɛ maa te si kɛ si Mawu Bi ɔ, nɛ e bui e muɔ nɛ e kɛ sã bɔ ɔ kaa nɔ́ ko nɛ he jua wa, nɛ e maa wo Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ngɔɔ Mawu mɔbɔ nami kɛ ba haa e nimli ɔmɛ ɔ mi mi fumi.<verse eid="HEB 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Ejakaa wa le nɔ nɛ de ke, “Ye blɔ fa mi nɔ́ ji kojomi; i ma pee mɛ kɛ to nane mi.” Lɛ kɛ nɛ e de ke, “Nutsɔ ɔ nitsɛ nɛ maa kojo e nimli ɔmɛ.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />O nɛ, e maa pee gbeye ke Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ nine maa su nɔ ko nɔ.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Nyɛ kai nyakpɛ be ɔmɛ, be nɛ nyɛ le Kristo kekleekle ɔ, bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɔ nyɛ he kɛ pɛtɛ e he, be mi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ amanehlu nae tete. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Be komɛ ɔ, a muɔ nyɛ nɛ a fiaa nyɛ kpa, nɛ be komɛ hu nyɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ a pee ni komɛ jamɛ a ni ɔmɛ nɔuu ha, nɛ a ni pee nyɛ mɔbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Nyɛ na nɔ́ kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a wo mɛ tsu mi ɔmɛ; nɛ nyɛ bua jɔ nyɛ he benɛ a kpɔ nyɛ níhi ngɛ nyɛ dɛ ɔ, ejakaa nyɛ le kaa nɔ́ kpakpahi ngɛ nyɛ hɛ mi nɛ nyɛ ma na ngɛ hiɔwe, níhi nɛ maa pee nyɛ nɔ́ daa.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ ji ha a, nyɛɛ pɛtɛ nyɛ hɛ nɛ nyɛ kɛ fɔ Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ mi wawɛɛ, ejakaa e hwɔɔ se hiɔwo ɔ kle agbo. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />E he hia kaa nyɛɛ to nyɛ tsui si nɛ nyɛɛ pee Mawu suɔmi nya ni, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ nine nɛ su nɔ́ nɛ e wo nyɛ si ngɛ he ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />E be kɛe nɛ e maa su si. <verse eid="HEB 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a ji dali ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi nya a, a hɛɛ a dami ɔ mi, nɛ a he e nɔ nɛ a ye ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi, ejakaa ke a kpale ngɛ se ɔ, Mawu be a he bua jɔmi nae.<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Se wa kpale we ngɛ Mawu se, nɛ wa ngmɛɛ we wa hemi kɛ yemi ɔ he. Wa hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ e mi ɔ deɔ wɔ kaa wa susumahi ma na yi wami hemi.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nyakpɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Mɛni ji hemi kɛ yemi? E ji hɛ nɔ kami kaa nɔ́ ko nɛ wa ngɛ hlae ɔ maa ba mi. Nɛ wa ngɛ nɔ mi mami klɛdɛɛ ngɛ wa mi kaa níhi nɛ wa ngɛ blɔ hyɛe ɔmɛ maa su wa dɛ; nɛ wa nuɔ he ngɛ wa mi paa kaa wa nɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ wa hɛ ngmɛ mohu se wa he ye kaa a ngɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ɔ he je nɛ blema bi ɔmɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi ngɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Hemi kɛ yemi nɔ nɛ wa da kɛ le kaa Mawu nya mi munyu nɛ a kɛ bɔ je ɔ, nɛ e ba mi kaa nɔ́ nɛ wa nɛ kɛ wa hɛ ngmɛ ɔ mi nɛ a je kɛ pee nɔ́ nɛ fɔɔ si paa nɛ hɛ ngmɛ ngɛ hyɛe ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ Habel bu Mawu tue ngɛ nɛ e sã bɔ, nɛ e gu bɔ ɔ nɔ kɛ pee dalɔ nɛ Mawu he e nike ni ɔ kɛ ye e hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ɔ he odase. E ngɛ mi kaa Habel gbo momoomo mohu lɛɛ, se e he sane ɔ ji ni kasemi kɛ ha wɔ nɛ wa maa gu nɔ kɛ he Mawu ye.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Hemi kɛ yemi he nɛ a wo Henok kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ngɛ nɛ a ha we nɛ e gbo. Nɛ nɔ ko nɛ le, ejakaa Mawu wo lɛ. Nɛ loko ji a ma wo lɛ ɔ, Mawu ye e he odase kaa e sa e hɛ mi. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Nɔ ko be Mawu hɛ mi nyɛe maa sa be mi nɛ jamɛatsɛ ɔ he we Mawu nɔ yi, nɛ e ngɔɛ e hɛ kɛ fɔɛ e nɔ. Ke nɔ ko maa hɛ kɛ su Mawu he ɔ, e bi nɛ e he ye kaa Mawu ngɛ nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ hlaa e se blɔ anɔkuale mi ɔ, a naa lɛ, nɛ a naa he hiɔwo.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Nɛ Noa hu ji nɔ ko nɛ he Mawu ye. Benɛ e nu Mawu si womi ngɛ be nɛ maa ba a he ɔ, e bu tue. E ngɛ mi kaa e nɛ nyu jemi ɔ nɛ maa ba a he okadi ko mohu se e puɛ we be nɛ e kpɛ lɛ nɛ e kɛ he e kɛ e we ɔ tsuo yi wami. Hemi nɛ Noa he Mawu nɔ ye ɔ ji slɔɔto nɛ ngɛ e kɛ yayami peemi je ɔ nɛ he we Mawu nɔ yi nɛ a bui lɛ tue ɔ a kpɛti. Nɛ ngɛ e hemi kɛ yemi ɔ he je ɔ, e ba pee nihi nɛ Mawu ngɔ mɛ ɔ a kpɛti nɔ kake.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ Abraham bu Mawu tue ngɛ, nɛ benɛ a tsɛ lɛ nɛ a de lɛ ke e hia kɛ je e ma mi kɛ ho zugba lokoo nɛ a ma kɛ ha lɛ kaa e gbosi ni ɔ nɔ ya a, e kua we. Nɛ benɛ e hia a, e li he tete nɛ e yaa. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ e ya hi si womi zugba a nɔ, ngɛ bo tsuhi a mi kaa nubwɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ Isak kɛ Yakob nɛ Mawu ha mɛ hu jamɛ a si womi ɔ nɔuu ɔ pee ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Abraham pee enɛ ɔ, ejakaa e ngɛ Mawu blɔ hyɛe kɛ hɛ nɔ kami, konɛ e ngɔ lɛ kɛ ho hiɔwe ma nɛ ngɛ sisi tomi nɛ he wa a mi ya, nɛ e peelɔ kɛ e malɔ ji Mawu ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ Sara hu ba pee yo fɔlɔ ngɛ be mi nɛ e bwɔ. Se e he nɔ nɛ wo lɛ si ɔ ye, ejakaa e le kaa anɔkualetsɛ ji lɛ nɛ e maa pee nɔ́ nɛ e de ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a na ma mluku kɛ je Abraham mi, nɔ nɛ bwɔ jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ e be bi kake tete nyɛe ma fɔ. Se e bibimibibimɛ hiɛ fuu kaa hiɔwe dodoehi loo wo nya zia nɛ a be nyɛe kanemi.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Nimli nɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo gbo be mi nɛ níhi nɛ a wo mɛ si ngɛ he ɔ tsuo sui a dɛ, se a na kaa e fɔɔ si ha mɛ nɛ a bua jɔ, ejakaa a le kaa zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ pi a sihi he se mohu nibwɔhi ji mɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Nɛ ke a de ja a, nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ ji kaa a hɛ ngɛ a we nitsɛ ɔ nɔ ngɛ hiɔwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Kaa a suɔ ɔ, jinɛ a ko kpale kɛ ya nyɛɛ je nɛ ɔ mi ní kpa amɛ a se ekohu. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Se a sume. A ngɛ hiɔwe he blɔ hlae nɛ a ya. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e pee we Mawu zo kaa a ma tsɛ lɛ ke a Mawu, ejakaa e dla hiɔwe sihi he ngɔ to mɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Be nɛ Mawu ngɛ Abraham kae ɔ, Abraham he Mawu kɛ e si womi ɔmɛ nɛ e ye lolo, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ngɔ e bi Isak ngɔ ha kɛ ha bɔ sami, nɛ e pee klaalo nɛ e maa gbe lɛ ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Tsɛ be ɔ, kɛ gu Isak nɔ, nɛ Mawu wo si kaa e ma ha Abraham bimɛ babauu ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />E he ye kaa ke Isak gbo tete ɔ, Mawu ma nyɛ ma tle lɛ si ekohu, nɛ lɔ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ ko ba mi ɔ nɛ, ejakaa ngɛ Abraham blɔ fa mi ɔ, e sa nɛ e gbe Isak, se e kpale kɛ ba wami mi ekohu. <verse eid="HEB 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ Isak le ngɛ kaa Mawu maa gbaa e bimɛ Yakob kɛ Esau hwɔɔ se.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ benɛ Yakob maa je je mi ɔ, e jɔɔ Yosef bimɛ nyumuwi enyɔ ɔmɛ benɛ e ma e yi si ngɛ e dema tso ɔ nɔ nɛ e sɔle ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ benɛ Yosef nyagbe maa ho sumi ya a, e tu Mawu he munyu kɛ nɔ mi mami kaa e ma je Israel bi ɔmɛ kɛ je Mizraim. Nɛ akɛnɛ e he ye veveeve he je ɔ, e ha nɛ a wo lɛ si kaa a maa ngɔ e wuhi kɛ ya. <verse eid="HEB 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ Mose fɔli ɔmɛ wo lɛ kɛ ya laa hlami etɛ sɔuu ngɛ, benɛ e ngɛ bimwɔyo mi. A na kaa Mawu ha mɛ bi pɔtɛɛ ko, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a na hemi kɛ yemi nɛ a yi gbeye. A he ye kaa a maa baa e yi kɛ je gbe nɛ Matsɛ ɔ ke a gbe mɛ ɔ dɛ mi.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ benɛ Mose ba wa a, e kplɛɛ we kaa a tsɛ lɛ Matsɛ Farao bibi ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Nɛ e suɔ mohu kaa e kɛ Mawu bi ɔmɛ maa na nisɛ ni a ni pe nɛ e maa ye yayami mi ngɔɔmi nɛ se kɛ we ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Ejakaa e na kaa ke e na nɔ nɛ e pue e hɛ mi si ngɛ Kristo he ɔ, e maa pee ni nami nɛ kle si abɔ ha lɛ pe Mizraim ni nami loo weto ni slɔɔtohi nɛ e ma na a. Ejakaa e ngɛ hwɔɔ se hiɔwo nɛ Mawu ma ha lɛ ɔ blɔ hyɛe. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ e je Mizraim ngɛ nɛ e yi matsɛ ɔ abofu gbeye; nɛ e ya e hɛ mi tɛɛ kaa nɔ ko nɛ ngɛ Mawu hyɛe paa. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ e ha nɛ a gbe jijɔ bi ngɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu fa lɛ ɔ, nɛ a ngɔ e muɔ ɔ kɛ fiã a sinya tso ɔmɛ a he ngɛ a we ɔmɛ a mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Mawu Bɔfo nɔ hɛ mi kpatalɔ ɔ nɛ ko ta bi tɛte ɔmɛ a he ngɛ a we ɔmɛ a mi kaa bɔ nɛ e pee Mizraim bi ɔmɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ po Wo Tsutsu ɔ ngɛ kaa nihi nɛ ngɛ zugba gbigbli nɔ nyɛɛe. Se benɛ Mizraim bi ɔmɛ hu ka nɛ a maa po ɔ, a tlɔ wo ɔ mi.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Hemi ke yemi nya nɛ Yeriko gbogbo ɔmɛ hule pue si ngɛ benɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ bɔle ma a ligbi kpaago se ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ yo ajuama Rahab hɛ mi kpataa we kɛ piɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ gbo tue ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa e he Mawu ye nɛ e he hwɔɔli ɔmɛ ngɔ to we nɛ e ye kɛ bua mɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nihi nɛ je ɔ mi sɛ mɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Mɛni i ma pa de? Be bé nɛ wa maa bɔ Gideon kɛ Barak, Samson kɛ Jefta, David kɛ Samuel kɛ gbali ɔmɛ a hemi kɛ yemi he sane piɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ he Mawu ye, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a ye kunimi ngɛ tahi a mi. A ye mahi a nɔ nɛ a hɛɛ a sisi bi ɔmɛ saminya. A nine su si womi nɛ Mawu wo mɛ ɔ nɔ; nɛ benɛ a kɛ mɛ wo jatahi a muɔ mi kɛ flɔɔnɔɔ nɛ ngɛ tsoe glegleegle mi tete ɔ, awi ko yi mɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />A ti nihi lɛɛ ngɛ a hemi kɛ yemi nya a, a je ta hahi a nya, nɛ a ti nihi na he wami ngɛ a gbɔjɔmi kɛ hiɔ numi se. A ti nihi hu tsu nyakpɛ he wami ni nguahi ngɛ ta mi, nɛ a gbɛ he nyɛli a ta slɔɔtohi kɛ fiã. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Yihi komɛ hu, ngɛ a hemi kɛ yemi nya a, a suɔli nɛ gbo ɔmɛ te si ekohu. Se ni komɛ hu nɛ he Mawu ye ɔ, a kpata a hɛ mi. A suɔmi nya ji kaa a ma gbo mohu pe nɔ nɛ a maa kpale ngɛ Mawu se nɛ a ngmɛɛ a he, ejakaa a hemi kɛ yemi ji hwɔɔ se ɔ, a ma na si himi nɛ hi pe nɔ nɛ mi nɛ a ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />A ye a ti ni komɛ a he fɛu; a fiaa ni komɛ kpa, nɛ a wo ni komɛ hu kɔsɔkɔsɔ, nɛ a wo mɛ tsu. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />A fiaa ni komɛ tɛ nɛ a gbe mɛ, nɛ a poo ni komɛ a mi kɛ sãu. A gbe ni komɛ hu kɛ ha. A ti ni komɛ hu jijɔ kɛ apletsi he womihi ji a he bo nɛ a bu. A hi fimi mi, a wa mɛ yi mi nɛ a pee mɛ nisɛ ni a ni. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Je ɔ mi hí kɛ ha mɛ. A nyɛɛ kɛkɛ ngɛ ngahi kɛ yohi a nɔ, nɛ a hi muɔhi kɛ tɛ puɔhi a mi kaa nihi nɛ ta fie mɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo sa Mawu hɛ mi ngɛ a hemi kɛ yemi ɔ nya mohu, se a nine sui a si womi ɔmɛ tsuo nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Ejakaa Mawu suɔmi nya ji kaa a to a tsui si nɛ a nine nɛ su hiɔwo nɛ hi pe lɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ hwɔɔ se.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Ke ji wa ngɛ hemi kɛ yemitsɛmɛ fuu kaa kikɛ ɔ nɛ ngɛ wɔ hyɛe ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ ha nɛ waa ngmɛɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ wɔ blɔ tsie, titli ɔ, yayami ɔmɛ nɛ du wa he ɔmɛ a he nɛ wa wo hɛ mi miami kɛ tsui si tomi kɛ tu fo nɛ Mawu kɛ fɔ wa hɛ mi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Nɛ waa ngɔ wa hɛ kɛ fɔ Yesu nɛ ji wa hlamitsɛ kɛ Tsɔɔlɔ ɔ nɔ. Nɔ nɛ ngɔ e he kɛ ha hɛ mi si puemi gbenɔ ngɛ sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ, ejakaa e le bua jɔmi nɛ e ma na ngɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ. Nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e hii si ngɛ anunyami Matsɛyemi Sɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Nyɛ kai nɔ́ nɛ e na ngɛ yayami peeli a dɛ mi kɛ ninyɛ nɛ a ngɔ kpee lɛ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ pɔ nɛ ko tɔ nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ kɔni mi nɛ jɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Tete po ɔ, muɔ si puemi ko be ta nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ yayami ngɛ hwue ɔ mi lolo.<verse eid="HEB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu tue gblami sa wɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Nɛ i heɔ yeɔ kaa nyɛ hɛ ji he wami womi munyuhi nɛ Mawu tu nyɛ kaa e bimɛ ɔ a nɔ ke, “Ye bi, ke Nutsɔ ɔ sa tue ha mo ɔ, o mi mi nɛ ko fu. O nine mi nɛ ko wo nyu ke e ngɛ mo he nɛ o dɛ ngɛ ɔ tsɔɔe. <verse eid="HEB 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Ejakaa Mawetsɛ ɔ gblaa nɔ nɛ e suɔ lɛ ɔ tue, nɛ e tsɔseɔ nɔ nɛ ji e bi.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Nyɛ ha nɛ Mawu nɛ tsɔse nyɛ, ejakaa e ngɛ nyɛ tsɔsee kaa bɔ nɛ tsɛ fɛɛ tsɛ nɛ suɔ e bimɛ peeɔ ɔ. Mɛnɔ na bi nɛ e tsɛ tui lɛ munyu hyɛ? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Ke ji Mawu gblɛ nyɛ tue ngɛ be nɛ sa mi ɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ tsɛmɛ peeɔ a bi ɔmɛ ɔ, lɛɛ e tsɔɔ kaa tsa pi Mawu bimɛ ji nyɛ niinɛ, nɛ nyɛ piɛ we e weku ɔ he. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Enɛ ɔ se hu ɔ, wa buu wa zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ tsɛmɛ a tsɔsemi tue, tse be ɔ, a gblaa wa tue. Mɛni he je mɔ nɛ e sɛ nɛ wa woɔ wa he kɛ haa Mawu kɛ bua jɔmi nɛ e tsɔse wɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ waa hi si pɛpɛɛpɛ?<verse eid="HEB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Wa zugba a nɔ tsɛmɛ tsɔseɔ wɔ jehahi bɔɔ, bɔ nɛ a le kɛ bɔ nɛ a susuu kaa e maa hi ha wɔ, se wa Hiɔwetsɛ ɔ tsɔseɔ wɔ ngɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa kpakpa he, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wɔ hu wa na e klɔuklɔu peemi ɔ eko. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Tsɔsemi ko ngɔɛ ha nɔ, be mi nɛ a ngɛ lɛ tsɔsee ɔ; se pee se ɔ e naa e he se nami ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ wlua nyɛ he, nyɛ wo nyɛ ninehi nɛ a mi jɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ da si kpɛii ngɛ nyɛ nanehi nɛ a mi gbɔjɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Nɛ nyɛɛ je blɔ dadehi nɛ a nɔ tɛ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ nyɛ se nɛ a gbɔjɔ ɔmɛ a ko nɔ si nɛ a plaa a he, se mohu a na he wami.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛ kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hi si ngɛ tue mi jɔmi mi, nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ nyɛ he nɛ tsɔ nɛ nyɛɛ hi klɔuklɔu, ejakaa nɔ nɛ be klɔuklɔu ɔ, e be Nutsɔ ɔ nae.<verse eid="HEB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e hyɛ e nyɛmi nɔ saminya, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ e na Mawu jɔɔmi ɔ; nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ e hi nɛ pɛ nɛ ko hi nyɛ kpɛti; ejakaa e woɔ haomi agbo kɛ baa, nɛ e yeɔ nihi a hemi kɛ yemi awi. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e ko bɔ ajuama loo nɛ e ko bu Mawu blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ yaka gu kaa bɔ nɛ Esau pee nɛ e wo si kake nya mi ngma kɛ tsake e nɔkɔtɔma blɔ nya a. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Nyɛ ma kai kaa pee se ɔ, benɛ e ngɛ hlae kaa a kpale kɛ ha lɛ nɛ e fo ya tete ngɛ he ɔ, e nine sui nɔ, ejakaa be ɔ be.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu agbo jemi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />E sɛ nɛ nyɛɛ na nɔ́ ko nɛ ngɛ gbeyegbeye kaa la nɛ ngɛ tsoe glegleegle, diblii kpii kɛ kɔɔhiɔ nɛ nya wa kaa bɔ nɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ na ngɛ Sinai Yoku ɔ he benɛ Mawu ha mɛ e mlaa amɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />Ejakaa bɛ ko pɛ gbeyegbeye, nɛ gbi ko tu mɛ munyu nɛ ngɛ gbeye bɔ nɛ ni ɔmɛ kpa Mawu pɛɛ kaa e kpa munyu ɔ tumi. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Bɔ nɛ Mawu fami ɔ ngɛ ha a, a kpale senyasenya nɛ ke lohwe nane eywiɛtse po nɛ e he sa yoku ɔ he ɔ, e ko gbo. <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Anɔkuale ji kaa Mose nitsɛ po ye gbeye ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ e na a he nɛ e kpokpo.<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Se mohu nyɛ ba Zion Yoku kɛ Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ hiɔwe ma nɛ ji Yerusalem ɔ mi, kɛ bɔfohi babauu nɛ bua ngɛ bua jɔmi nɔ ɔ a kpɛti. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Nɛ nyɛ ba asafo ɔ nɛ ji nihi nɛ a ngma a biɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ, kɛ Mawu nɛ ji nihi tsuo a kojolɔ ɔ, kɛ dali nɛ hi kɛ pi si nɛ a he mɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ a mumihi a ngɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Nɛ nyɛ ba Yesu nitsɛ nɛ kɛ e nyakpɛ somi he ɔ ba ha wɔ ɔ ngɔ; kɛ muɔ nɛ a fiã pue si ɔ, nɛ fɔɔ si kɛ ha yayami pami ɔ, pe muɔ nɛ biɔ nane mi tomi kaa bɔ nɛ Habel nɔ́ ɔ pee ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ bu nɔ́ nɛ munyu tulɔ ɔ ngɛ dee ɔ tue. Ejakaa ke Israel bi ɔmɛ yi a he benɛ a kua Mose nɛ ji zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ tsɔlɔ tue ɔ, kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ wa be tue gblami agbo nae ke wa bui Mawu nɛ tu munyu kɛ je hiɔwe ɔ tue. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Benɛ e tu munyu kɛ je Sinai Yoku ɔ he ɔ, e gbi hoso zugba a, nɛ e de ke, “Jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ i be zugba a kɛkɛ huanyae, se kɛ hiɔwe ɔ hulɔ.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Nɔ́ nɛ e ngɛ tsɔɔe ji kaa e ma tsake nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ be sisi tomi kpakpa nɛ ma huanya a, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, níhi nɛ maa si kpɛii ɔ ji níhi nɛ maa hi si.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ waa na Mawu si kaa wa nine su matsɛ yemi nɛ nɔ ko be nyɛe hɛ mi ma kpata nɔ. Nɛ wa sɔmɔ Mawu ngɛ blɔ nɛ maa sa e hɛ mi nɔ, kɛ bumi kɛ gbeye yemi. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Ejakaa wa Mawu ɔ e ji la nɛ kpataa nɔ hɛ mi.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Slɔmi kɛ sɛ yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Nyɛ ha nɛ anɔkua nyɛmi suɔmi nɛ hi nyɛ kpɛti. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Nyɛ ko kpa nihi nubwɔ peemi; ejakaa kɛ gu enɛ ɔ peemi nɔ ɔ, nihi pee bɔfohi nubwɔ nɛ a li. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Nyɛ kai nihi nɛ a wo mɛ tsu ɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he kaa nɔ́ nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ tsuo nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nae ɔ nɛ. Nyɛ kai nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ yi kpɛti wae ɔmɛ, ejakaa nyɛ le nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ nae ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Nyɛɛ bu gba si himi kɛ e mi mlaa amɛ nɛ nyɛɛ hi si klɔuklɔu; ejakaa Mawu maa kojo gba puɛlɔ kɛ ajuama bɔlɔ.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Nyɛ ko wo sika suɔmi kɛ puɛ nyɛ si himi, nɛ nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ níhi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ dɛ ɔmɛ a he. Ejakaa Mawu de ke, “I be kpalee ngɛ o se, nɛ i be mo kuae kɔkɔɔkɔ.”<verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ma nyɛ ma de kɛ nɔ mi mami ke, “Mawu ji ye yemi kɛ bualɔ; i be nɔ́ nɛ adesa ko maa pee mi ɔ he gbeye yee.”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Nyɛ kai nyɛ hɛ mi nyɛɛli ɔmɛ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ fiɛɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ. Nyɛɛ hyɛ yiblii kpakpa amɛ nɛ a wo ngɛ a wami si himi mi ɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛ he Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye kaa bɔ nɛ a pee ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Bɔ nɛ Yesu Kristo ngɛ kɛ je hiɛ ɔ, ja a nɛ e ngɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ, nɛ ja a nɔuu e maa hi kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko ha nɛ tsɔɔmi he slɔɔtohi nɛ je ekpa nɛ mlɔɔ nyɛ. Nyɛ mumi mi he wami ji níke nɔ nɛ jee Mawu ngɔ, tsa pi kɔhi nɛ kɔɔ niye ni nɛ o maa ye he a nɔ yemi, lɔ ɔ ji blɔ nya tomi ko nɛ yi kɛ bua we nihi nɛ ka ja a peemi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Wa ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ nɛ ji sɛumi tso, he nɛ a sɛu Kristo ngɛ ɔ, nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ yi wami hemi se blɔ hlae kɛ gu Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ ɔ, a be nyɛe maa ye kɛ bua mɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa a nya a, osɔfo nɔkɔtɔma a woɔ lohwehi nɛ a gbe ɔmɛ a muɔ kɛ baa he klɔuklɔu ɔ kaa yayami he bɔ sami, nɛ a saa lohwe ɔmɛ nitsɛ ngɛ ma a agbo ɔ se. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Yesu hu na nɔ́ nɛ e gbo ngɛ ma a agbo ɔ se he nɛ e wo lɛ nitsɛ e muɔ kɛ fɔ wa he yayamihi ngɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ waa je kpo kɛ ya na lɛ ngɛ agbo ɔ se konɛ wɔ hu wa na hɛ mi si puemi nɛ e na a eko. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Ejakaa tsa pi wa we ji je nɛ ɔ, wa ngɛ wa neneene we nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ tioe.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Lɛɛ kɛ gu Yesu yemi ke buami nɔ ɔ, wa maa sa yi jemi afɔle daa kɛ daa kɛ ha Mawu, nɛ wa ma de ni kpahi bɔ nɛ e biɛ ɔ hɛ mi ngɛ anunyami ha. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Nyɛ hɛ nɛ ko je kpakpa peemi nɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua nihi nɛ e fi mɛ ɔ kɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ e mi eko, ejakaa afɔle sami nɛ ngɛ kaa ja a ji nɔ́ nɛ saa Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="HEB 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Nyɛɛ bu nyɛ asafo hɛ mi nyɛɛli ɔmɛ tue nɛ nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si ha mɛ, nɛ nyɛɛ pee níhi nɛ a ma de nyɛ ɔ. Ejakaa a ni tsumi ji kaa a baa nyɛ susumahi a yi, nɛ hwɔɔ se ɔ Mawu maa kojo mɛ ngɛ he. Nyɛ ha nɛ a tsu enɛ ɔ kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ, se pi kɛ kɔmɔ yemi, ke pi ja a, nyɛ hu nyɛ maa na e mi ní.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Nyɛɛ sɔle nɛ nyɛ kpa pɛɛ kɛ ha wɔ. Wa heɔ yeɔ kaa wa hɛɛ he nile kpakpa, ejakaa wa suɔmi nya ji waa pee nɔ́ nɛ da be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Nyɛ sɔlemi he hia mi saminya amlɔ nɛ ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma nyɛ ma kpale kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ ngɛ be kpiti mi.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20-21" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, ye sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami ji kaa He jɔmi Mawu ɔ, nɔ nɛ tle wa Nutsɔ Yesu si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, e ha nyɛ níhi nɛ he hia nyɛ ɔ tsuo nɛ nyɛ kɛ pee e suɔmi nya ni. Lɛ nɛ e ba pee to ɔmɛ a nɔ hyɛlɔ ngua, ngɛ e muɔ nɛ e kɛ ma nyɛɛ kɛ Mawu kpɛti neneene somi ɔ nɔ mi ɔ. E tsu ni tsumi nɛ e suɔ ngɛ Kristo he wami nya ngɛ nyɛ mi. Lɛ nɛ a ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha kɛ ya neneene. Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Nɛ i kpa nyɛ pɛɛ, ye nyɛmimɛ, nyɛɛ bu ye womi kpiti nɛ ɔ mi he wami womi munyu nɛ ɔ tue kɛ tsui si tomi. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />I ngɛ nyɛ lemi hae kaa a ngmɛɛ wa nyɛmi Timoteo he; nɛ ke e maa ba hiɛ ɔ be kpiti mi ɔ, i kɛ lɛ tsuo maa ba nyɛ ngɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />I biɔ nyɛ hɛ mi nyɛɛli ɔmɛ kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ heɔ yeɔ ɔmɛ tsuo. Ni nɛmɛ nɛ je Italia nɛ a kɛ mi ba ngɛ hiɛ ɔ tsuo biɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Mawu dloomi ɔ nɛ kɛ nyɛ tsuo nɛ hi si. Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>